// Questions about Libra's own docs, worded differently from them. For a workspace built with:
//   libra kb add README.md LEARN.md INSTALL.md SECURITY.md CONTRIBUTING.md deploy/README.md docs/MOBILE.md docs/REVIEW.md clients/java/README.md
{"question": "my handset was stolen, how do I cut it off", "expect": "devices revoke|Revoke"}
