{"question": "what keeps a bad model from replacing a good one", "expect": "held-out|rollback|gate"}
{"question": "how do I see what the agent did", "expect": "--events|audit|journalctl"}
{"question": "where are my settings stored", "expect": "LIBRA_HOME|~/\\.libra"}
